   "title": "Ternmark — A house of distinction (Luxury)",
   "rules": "11 · s09 — Luxury / house of distinction. The rules: a hairline frame that keeps the page inside a margin of air; centred symmetry on a single axis; a light-weight serif at a size that forces the eye to slow down, and a geometric sans in small capitals at wide tracking for everything that labels; rules and ornaments, never boxes; one gold, used for lines and ornaments only — where gold must be read, it is darkened to 5.2:1. Motion is a 400 ms colour change, and it is removed on request.",
